today we're talking about minecraft  getting some cute new blocks how the  sequel to jedi fall in order might be  revealed soon and more  let's start with a minecraft beta update  for players participating in minecraft's  beta program you're getting some cool  additions one of which is a new block  called frog light which is an  interesting new alternative to sea  lanterns and other light blocks these  blocks emit light and can be obtained by  luring a frog close to a small magna  cube the frog will then eat the cube and  a frog like block will drop there are  three types of frog like blocks and each  frog variant will cause a different one  to drop these types are pearlescent  verdant and ochre and can be placed in  different directions frogs and tadpoles  also have new audio and animations that  really help bring this new mob to life  and tadpoles now have a panic goal that  will help them find water if they get  stuck on land some other changes  included in this beta are coral now  generates in the deeper depths of warm  oceans and skeleton horsemen now  pathfind correctly among other things  switching gears to some star wars news  star wars jedi fallen order is getting a  sequel and according to reporter jeff  grubb it will be announced before e3  2022 speaking on today's episode of grub  snacks on gamespot's sister site giant  bomb grubb said quote expect to hear  about the game in a significant way  before e3 he added that there is a  chance that the game is released in 2022  but the more likely bet is that it will  arrive in early 2023 2019's jedi fallen  order was developed by titanfall studio  respawn and sold more than 10 million  copies making it one of the most  commercially successful star wars games  in history a sequel has been rumored for  some time and respawn recently hired  halo infinite multiplayer designer  patrick wren to work on star wars ea is  no longer the exclusive publisher of  star wars games on console as lucasfilm  and disney are now working with other  companies as well for example ubisoft is  making an open world star wars game  while quantic dream is creating a title  called star wars eclipse  and speaking of games we may hear more  about soon reporter tom henderson wrote  on twitter quote multiple people have  confirmed that the rumored remake of the  last of us for ps5 is quote nearly  finished and might launch in the second  half of 2022. separately vgc said it  heard the same thing from its own  sources about the remake of the last of  us for ps5 launching in the latter half  of 2022 additionally henderson said the  idea with all these last of us related  projects is to quote drum up hype for  the upcoming last of us tv show for hbo  starring pedro pascal's joel and bella  ramsay as ellie the show is in  production now but doesn't have a  release date during ces 2022 this week  naughty dog's neil druckmann said the  studio was quote dying to show off  multiple games it has in development but  didn't give any hints or clues as to  what those games are the next release  from naughty dog will be uncharted  legacy of thieves collection which  launches january 28th for ps5 and later  on pc so are you in that minecraft beta  program and are you loving those new  frog lights let me know in the comments  below and i'll see you tomorrow  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

